   "source": [
    "# Tier 5 â€” Life-cycle assessment (LCA)\n",
    "\n",
    "BioSTEAM attaches **characterization factors (CFs)** to streams and utilities, then\n",
    "aggregates them over a `System` to a life-cycle impact (here **GWP**, kg CO2-eq).\n",
    "This tier:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Defines an impact indicator and sets CFs on feeds and electricity.\n",
    "2. Computes the system's total feed + utility impact.\n",
    "3. Expresses impact per kg of product and explores **allocation** (mass, energy,\n",
    "   economic) between a main product and a co-product."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "8c2f0ceb",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-12T11:46:17.665901Z",
